     1,
     "<div>This is an outline of what Luis helped me figure out, for general consumption:</div><div><br></div><div>**this is using the current dev version of dartR (Version 2.3.3)<br></div><div><br></div><div>1. Download newhybrids from <a href=\"https://github.com/green-striped-gecko/dartR/tree/master/binaries\" style=\"font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;white-space:normal\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/green-striped-gecko/dartR/tree/master/binaries&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792458776171000&amp;usg=AOvVaw21CsyllEZurYCFwRruBF1Q\">https://github.com/green-striped-gecko/dartR/tree/master/binaries</a><span style=\"font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;white-space:normal\"> <br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;white-space:normal\">2. Place newhybrids IN the folder that is your working directory. The process does not work if newhybrids is in a different directory. This is because newhybrids is trying to look at files that are in the same folder as itself. You can either make lots of copies of newhybrids in your working folders, or change the working directory to where newhybrids is stored. Option two means your newhybrids outputs will be written to this new directory, obviously.<br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;white-space:normal\">3. Run newhybrids via the r code :<br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;white-space:normal\"><br></span></div><div><div style=\"font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;white-space:normal\">m &lt;- gl.nhybrids(<a href=\"http://testset.gl/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://testset.gl/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792458776171000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3MubZ6rID_OaphE_ZcB7wL\">testset.gl</a>, outfile=&#39;nhyb.txt&#39;,</div><div style=\"font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;white-space:normal\">                 p0=NULL, p1=NULL,</div><div style=\"font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;white-space:normal\">                 nhyb.directory=getwd(),</div><div style=\"font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;white-space:normal\">                 BurnIn=100,</div><div style=\"font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;white-space:normal\">                 sweeps=100,</div><div style=\"font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;white-space:normal\">                 verbose=3)</div><div style=\"font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;white-space:normal\"><br></div><div style=\"font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;white-space:normal\">Some errors and how to resolve them:</div><div style=\"font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;white-space:normal\"><br></div><div style=\"font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;white-space:normal\">Permission denied issues (i.e &quot;<span style=\"font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;white-space:normal\">sh: /path_to_file/newhybs: Permission denied&quot;)</span> can be resolved in terminal with the command:<br></div><div style=\"font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;white-space:normal\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;white-space:normal\">chmod 755 path_to_file/newhybs</span></div><div style=\"font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;white-space:normal\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;white-space:normal\"><br></span></div><div style=\"font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;white-space:normal\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;white-space:normal\">If you have any spaces anywhere in your path name you will fail. Newhybrids does not understand spaces in path names.</span></div><div style=\"font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;white-space:normal\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;white-space:normal\"><br></span></div><div style=\"font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;white-space:normal\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;white-space:normal\"><br></span></div><div style=\"font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;white-space:normal\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;white-space:normal\"><br></span></div><div style=\"font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;white-space:normal\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;white-space:normal\"><br></span></div><span style=\"font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;white-space:normal\"></span></div>"
    ]
   ]
  }
